id: perfection-karyon-core
name: Karyon Core
order: 5
slot: trait
# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: perfect-traits
groupLabel: Perfect Traits
description: >
  You are able to regenerate even from apparent death, allowing you to stand back up in the face of what would otherwise be defeat.
text: >
  Karyon Core: You are able to regenerate even from apparent death, allowing you to stand back up in the face of what would otherwise be defeat.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Surgency by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered/Defeated]: At the start of your next turn, instead of skipping your turn, use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver, stop being Defeated, and take your turn as normal. This effect cannot be triggered if the Attacking Maneuver that Defeated you dealt Damage exceeding 1/3 of your Maximum Life Points.

---

# (1) Surgency 1(T).
[passive, effect 1]
surgency += 1(T);
# (2) Rising from Defeat with a Healing Surge: the table's.
